        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are no longer entirely a person.</p><ul><li>You need neither food, drink nor air, and you are <strong>immune to disease</strong>.</li><li>You are <strong>immune to the drained condition</strong>, and to any effect that would alter your physical form against your will (petrification, polymorph, and the like) &mdash; the symbiont is already using that space.</li><li>You can be healed by <strong>Repair</strong> as well as by anything that heals a creature.</li><li>You no longer have a discernible anatomy: you are <strong>immune to precision damage</strong> and to critical specialization effects of the knife and pick groups.</li></ul>"
        },
